                <pb facs="0112" n="24" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg24"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">German Empire.—Proclamation.</hi></head>
                <p>According to official declarations which have been made here by the Imperial
                    Russian Government and the Imperial Japanese Government, a state of war now
                    exists between Russia and Japan. This is hereby proclaimed, with the further
                    announcement that it is the duty of everyone within the territory of the Empire
                    and in the German protectorates, as well as of Germans in foreign lands, to
                    refrain from all acts contrary to the neutrality of Germany.</p>
                <p>Berlin, February 13, 1904.</p>
                <p>The Imperial Chancellor,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Count von Bülow.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
